{
 "_about": [
  "What the hub can install. Each entry lists its sources best first; the",
  "first one whose 'when' fits this device and that resolves is used, so a",
  "dead feed falls through to the next. Kinds: github / forgejo / gitlab",
  "release files (AppImage), flathub (user install), builtin (ships with the",
  "image). 'heavy_below' marks a chip it struggles on; 'starter' is the",
  "lowest chip it is part of the one-tap starter set from.",
  "Chips in order: sm8350 < sm8550 < sm8650 < sm8750.",
  "'unpack' (with 'start'): the release file is a .tar.* holding one app folder,",
  "unpacked into ~/Applications/<unpack> and started through <start>.",
  "_bundles: ready-made sets the store offers in one tap (only what's missing installs)."
 ],
